commit b5b8a66ee21878d8aa59ebd23201b2e78e49a053
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:02:03 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-img14,qa4-img29,qa4-img18): ppc budget shares, no auto-complete, platform-tag whitelist
    
    - img14: _apply_service_budget_shares now stamps budget_share onto
      services_bpc_scores AND ppc_opportunity_ranking AND ppc_blueprints
      (matched by normalized service name), weighted by opportunity_score
      (fallback bpc_score), deterministic ints summing to 100
      (ppc_viability_engine.py:326-459); optional budget_share added to the
      prompt schema.
    - img29/new5: auto-COMPLETED block deleted from ads_strategy.py:388-399
      - campaigns stay IN_PROGRESS until the explicit Complete action
      (POST /campaigns/{uuid}/complete/). completion.py exposes derived
      flags ad_generation_completed/visual_completed/review_completed
      (ads exist / visual image_url present / an approved ad review);
      CampaignSerializer exposes all three for the FE 9-step count.
    - img18: campaign/text_utils.py bracket cleaner is now case-insensitive
      but whitelist-only (known platform slugs); ads_strategy_engine
      sanitizer skips 'keywords' keys so Google exact-match keywords like
      [plumber] survive. ppc_viability.py error message reworded to
      'Brand services are required...' (usp_list no longer the source).
    - campaign/tests_qa4_budget_status.py: 14 tests.

